    "id": "DRAFT-NS115@2025-01-24-explanation",
    "kind": "explanation",
    "text": "Held for Legal. NS115 FCO–DUB was cancelled because NS114 never left Dublin in the storm, so EI-NSK never reached FCO. At STD 14:10Z FCO was calm, and at STA 17:00Z Dublin was 14 kt, after the 02:30–15:00Z window. Whether a knock-on return is extraordinary is a legal question (C-74/19); one question to Legal covers NS113, NS115 and NS117.",
